  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DG NEAR Residual Error Rate Study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of this contract is to calculate the Residual Error Rate of DG NEAR (RER), which is an important element for the Director-General&#xbf;s assurance on the legality and regularity of the expenditure. The residual error rate builds on a large number of checks on transactions, to identify errors that may persist once all the control activities have been carried out (residual error).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
